@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api

### PUT ruta: reemplazo completo (status no se envía) -> 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/routes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Riohacha Centro",
  "municipality": "Riohacha",
  "description": "Centro histórico, malecón y mercado viejo"
}

### PATCH ruta: cambio parcial -> 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/routes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Recorrido de martes y viernes"
}

### PUT punto: reemplazo completo -> 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/collection-points/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeId": 1,
  "name": "Tienda La Esquina",
  "address": "Calle 2 # 7-15, Riohacha",
  "visitOrder": 2
}

### PATCH punto: mover a una ruta inactiva -> 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/collection-points/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeId": 2
}
